<h1>Your password was changed</h1>
<p>Hi, {{name}}.</p>
<p>The password for your <strong>{{appName}}</strong> account was changed on <strong>{{changedAt}}</strong>.</p>
<p>If it was you, no action is needed.</p>
<p><strong>Don't recognize this change?</strong> Reset your password right away and contact <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>
{{> button url=(concat frontendUrl "/forgot-password") label="Reset my password"}}
